      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence1-16",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "美容儀，性沈靜，好讀書，手不釋卷。",
      "reading": "沈靜好讀，手不釋卷。",
      "note": "沈靜好讀，手不釋卷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 16,
      "end_codepoint": 33,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence1-33",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "家世顯貴，貲產充積，而樞獨居處率素，傍無交往，端坐一室，非公事未嘗出遊，榮利之懷淡如也。",
      "reading": "家富而自身率素少出。",
      "note": "家富而自身率素少出。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 33,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence1-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "起家梁祕書郎，歷太子舍人，輕車河東王主簿，安前邵陵王、中軍宣(成)[城]王二府功曹史。",
      "reading": "梁時起家祕書郎、歷太子舍人，入河東王、邵陵王及宣城王府。殿本「宣成王」，數位校記據哀太子大器傳作「城」。",
      "note": "梁時起家祕書郎、歷太子舍人，入河東王、邵陵王及宣城王府。殿本「宣成王」，數位校記據哀太子大器傳作「城」。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 120,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence1-120",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "侯景之亂，樞往吳郡省父，因丁父憂。",
      "reading": "侯景亂中赴吳郡省父，繼而丁父憂。",
      "note": "侯景亂中赴吳郡省父，繼而丁父憂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 120,
      "end_codepoint": 137,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence1-137",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "時四方擾亂，人求苟免，樞居喪以至孝聞。",
      "reading": "傳稱離亂居喪以孝聞。",
      "note": "傳稱離亂居喪以孝聞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 137,
      "end_codepoint": 156,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence1-156",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "王僧辯平侯景，鎮京城，衣冠爭往造請，樞獨杜門靜居，不求聞達。",
      "reading": "王僧辯平侯景後鎮京，樞仍不出求進。",
      "note": "王僧辯平侯景後鎮京，樞仍不出求進。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 156,
      "end_codepoint": 186,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "紹泰元年，徵為給事黃門侍郎。",
      "reading": "紹泰元年徵給事黃門侍郎。",
      "note": "紹泰元年徵給事黃門侍郎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 14,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence2-14",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "未拜，除員外散騎常侍，兼侍中。",
      "reading": "黃門侍郎未拜，即除員外散騎常侍並兼侍中。",
      "note": "黃門侍郎未拜，即除員外散騎常侍並兼侍中。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p002",
