    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "樞博聞彊識，明悉舊章。",
      "reading": "博聞彊識，議禮緣起。",
      "note": "博聞彊識，議禮緣起。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 11,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-11",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "初，高祖長女永世公主先適陳留太守錢蕆，生子岊，主及岊嵭卒于梁世。",
      "reading": "陳高祖長女永世公主先適陳留太守錢蕆，子岊與公主皆在梁時卒。殿本錢氏名刻蔵，數位作蕆。《南史》作永嗣。",
      "note": "陳高祖長女永世公主先適陳留太守錢蕆，子岊與公主皆在梁時卒。殿本錢氏名刻蔵，數位作蕆。《南史》作永嗣。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 11,
      "end_codepoint": 43,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-43",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "高祖受命，唯公主追封。",
      "reading": "高祖受命後只追封其女。",
      "note": "高祖受命後只追封其女。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 43,
      "end_codepoint": 54,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-54",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "至是將葬，尚書主客請詳議，欲加蕆駙馬都尉，并贈岊官。",
      "reading": "尚書主客請議：有意加錢蕆駙馬都尉、贈岊官。此句是主客所請。",
      "note": "尚書主客請議：有意加錢蕆駙馬都尉、贈岊官。此句是主客所請。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 54,
      "end_codepoint": 80,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-80",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "樞議曰：「昔王姬下嫁，必適諸侯，同姓為主，聞於公羊之說，車服不繫，顯於詩人之篇。",
      "reading": "袁樞舉王姬婚禮，引《公羊》同姓為主及詩人論車服。",
      "note": "袁樞舉王姬婚禮，引《公羊》同姓為主及詩人論車服。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 80,
      "end_codepoint": 120,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-120",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "漢氏初興，列侯尚主，自斯以後，降嬪素族。",
      "reading": "所引漢初尚主由列侯及庶族。",
      "note": "所引漢初尚主由列侯及庶族。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 120,
      "end_codepoint": 140,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-140",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "駙馬都尉置由漢武，或以假諸功臣，或以加於戚屬，是以魏曹植表駙馬、奉車趣為一號。",
      "reading": "樞追述漢武置駙馬都尉、魏曹植表駙馬與奉車一號。",
      "note": "樞追述漢武置駙馬都尉、魏曹植表駙馬與奉車一號。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 140,
      "end_codepoint": 179,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-179",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "齊職儀曰，凡尚公主必拜駙馬都尉，魏、晉以來，因為瞻準。",
      "reading": "引《齊職儀》述魏晉以後尚主之例。",
      "note": "引《齊職儀》述魏晉以後尚主之例。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 179,
      "end_codepoint": 206,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-206",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "蓋以王姬之重，庶姓之輕，若不加其等級，寧可合劜而酳，所以假駙馬之位，乃崇於皇女也。",
      "reading": "樞解釋以駙馬增皇女婚禮的地位。數位本「合劜」，殿本「合巹」。",
      "note": "樞解釋以駙馬增皇女婚禮的地位。數位本「合劜」，殿本「合巹」。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 206,
      "end_codepoint": 247,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:received_sentence3-247",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hb9_2gq_205_AA",
      "source_quote": "今公主早薨，伉儷已絕，既無禮數致疑，何須駙馬之授？",
      "reading": "樞以主薨、伉儷已絕論錢蕆無須追授駙馬。",
      "note": "樞以主薨、伉儷已絕論錢蕆無須追授駙馬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 247,
      "end_codepoint": 272,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
